 hundreds of iphone videos out there  already within the space of 10 minutes  of the iphone release what the dynamic  island is is simply a notification bar  that has been accelerated through the  use of hardware and software they've  implemented a unique software feature to  wrap around this hardware peel shaped  cutout it therefore enhances the beauty  of the pill shape cutout rather than  simply just making a defect on the  screen is able to provide you with quick  useful information that is available to  your fingertips at any point in time it  is something that is always on it is  something that is always active in the  background so the dynamic island is now  basically its own living breathing  notification center at the top of your  screen in typical apple fashion we have  a brand new feature that isn't new at  all the always-on display has been  around for years on all other devices  however apple likes to claim that  they've done something new and they've  done something innovative  unfortunately for apple this does  actually play in to their character and  what their users love  so from the very first day when the very  first iphone was released there was a  very simple feature on the iphone that  was hardware related and hasn't changed  since day one  i'm talking about the automatic  silencing switch one simple switch on  the side of your iphone is able to take  your phone from mute to loud in a matter  of seconds now this is critically  important to anybody in a meeting how  often have you seen somebody pull out  their iphone quickly switch it to silent  and put it away versus how many times  have you seen anybody pull out any other  device and try to understand how to put  this phone on silent and how to stop it  from ringing there is a very very  architectural purpose behind this and it  is truly something that apple has made  their very own now with the always on  display your phone is able to provide  you with all of these updates without  you being 